{
    "title": "Super Sus",
    "description": "Welcome to join the multiplayer social deduction game - Super Sus! Engage in intense gameplay with global players, as you strategize to safeguard your spaceship from the cunning Impostors determined to sabotage the mission and eliminate everyone aboard!\r\n\r\nEXPERIENCE INTRIGUE AND STRATEGY\r\n- Play as a Spacecrew: Achieve victory by completing all tasks or smartly identifying and voting out the impostors.\r\n- Play as an Impostor: Execute covert eliminations and deploy strategic sabotages to create discord among the Spacecrew.\r\n- Play as a Neutral: Each neutral role comes with unique objectives. Excel in these roles to claim your victory.\r\n- Teamwork is Key: Work closely with teammates to complete critical tasks and ensure the safety of your spaceship. Will you maintain trust, or will betrayal lead to chaos?\r\n\r\nPARTY FOR FUN\r\n- Duo and Squad Modes: Perfect for playing alongside friends and family. Team up, strategize, deduce, and enjoy the game together.\r\n- Private Rooms with Custom Rules: Take control by setting your own game rules and inviting friends and family to join.\r\n\r\nDIVERSE MODES:\r\n- Colosseum: Fight to be the last one standing in this ultimate survival challenge.\r\n- Hide & Seek: Complete tasks and dodge the hunters in this thrilling evasion showdown.\r\n- Lover Mode\uff1aStay alive with your lover and navigate challenges together to secure victory.\r\n- More: More modes are waiting for you to explore.\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY:\r\n- Upgrade Your Role: Enhance your roles with exclusive Emotes, Action Effects, Fashion outfits, and more. Stand out with your unique style!\r\n\r\nSTAY CONNECTED WITH US\r\n- Join our vibrant community: Follow us on Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, TikTok, Discord, and Instagram under \"Super Sus.\"\r\n- Explore Further: Visit our official website at https://www.supersus.io for more information, updates, and events!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to join the multiplayer social deduction game - Super Sus! Engage in intense gameplay with global players, as you strategize to safeguard your spaceship from the cunning Impostors determined to sabotage the mission and eliminate everyone aboard!<br><br>EXPERIENCE INTRIGUE AND STRATEGY<br>- Play as a Spacecrew: Achieve victory by completing all tasks or smartly identifying and voting out the impostors.<br>- Play as an Impostor: Execute covert eliminations and deploy strategic sabotages to create discord among the Spacecrew.<br>- Play as a Neutral: Each neutral role comes with unique objectives. Excel in these roles to claim your victory.<br>- Teamwork is Key: Work closely with teammates to complete critical tasks and ensure the safety of your spaceship. Will you maintain trust, or will betrayal lead to chaos?<br><br>PARTY FOR FUN<br>- Duo and Squad Modes: Perfect for playing alongside friends and family. Team up, strategize, deduce, and enjoy the game together.<br>- Private Rooms with Custom Rules: Take control by setting your own game rules and inviting friends and family to join.<br><br>DIVERSE MODES:<br>- Colosseum: Fight to be the last one standing in this ultimate survival challenge.<br>- Hide &amp; Seek: Complete tasks and dodge the hunters in this thrilling evasion showdown.<br>- Lover Mode\uff1aStay alive with your lover and navigate challenges together to secure victory.<br>- More: More modes are waiting for you to explore.<br><br>CUSTOMIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY:<br>- Upgrade Your Role: Enhance your roles with exclusive Emotes, Action Effects, Fashion outfits, and more. Stand out with your unique style!<br><br>STAY CONNECTED WITH US<br>- Join our vibrant community: Follow us on Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, TikTok, Discord, and Instagram under &quot;Super Sus.&quot;<br>- Explore Further: Visit our official website at https://www.supersus.io for more information, updates, and events!",
